<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5252] SqlFieldsQuery result set should expose fields metadata.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5252</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Internal class QueryCursorImpl can contains fields metadata, but QueryCursor does not provide any method for this. So, the only way for user to get metadata is to cast result object to internal class.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We should extend QueryCursor in child interface and change IgniteCache.query() return type for SqlFieldsQueries.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
